{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-skills","title":"五年级信息科技 — 调试技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming/debugging-skills","wordCount":2430,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"五年级信息科技-调试技巧\">五年级信息科技 — 调试技巧</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>编程中出现错误（Bug）是非常正常的事情，即使是经验丰富的程序员也会犯错。调试（Debug）就是发现和修复程序错误的过程。掌握调试技巧不仅能帮助我们更快地修复程序，还能加深对编程语言和算法逻辑的理解。</p>\n<p>本课将引导同学们认识 Python 中常见的错误类型，学会阅读错误信息，掌握系统化的调试方法，并通过实际案例练习排查和修复程序中的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>重要程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误的三大类型</td>\n<td>语法错误、运行时错误、逻辑错误</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阅读错误信息</td>\n<td>理解 Python 的错误提示</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>print 调试法</td>\n<td>用输出语句追踪程序执行</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐步排查法</td>\n<td>缩小错误范围、定位问题</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见错误模式</td>\n<td>拼写、缩进、类型、边界等典型错误</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>良好编程习惯</td>\n<td>预防错误的编码方法</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"认识三大错误类型\">认识三大错误类型</h3><p>编程中的错误主要分为三大类，每一类的表现形式和排查方法都不相同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>何时出现</th>\n<th>表现形式</th>\n<th>排查难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法错误（Syntax Error）</td>\n<td>程序运行前</td>\n<td>Python 报错，无法运行</td>\n<td>⭐⭐（较容易）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时错误（Runtime Error）</td>\n<td>程序运行中</td>\n<td>程序崩溃，显示错误信息</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐（中等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑错误（Logic Error）</td>\n<td>程序运行后</td>\n<td>程序能运行但结果不对</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐（较难）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>语法错误</strong>就像写作文时的错别字或标点错误，Python 在运行之前就会发现并报告。常见的语法错误包括：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 缺少冒号&#10;if score &gt;= 60&#10;    print(&quot;及格&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 括号不匹配&#10;print(&quot;你好&quot;&#10;&#10;# 缩进错误&#10;for i in range(5):&#10;print(i)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 缺少冒号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"及格\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 括号不匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你好\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 缩进错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行时错误</strong>在程序运行过程中发生，通常是因为遇到了无法处理的情况：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 除以零&#10;result = 100 / 0&#10;&#10;# 访问不存在的列表元素&#10;numbers = [1, 2, 3]&#10;print(numbers[5])&#10;&#10;# 类型不匹配&#10;age = input(&quot;输入年龄：&quot;)&#10;next_year = age + 1  # age 是字符串，不能直接加数字\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 除以零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 访问不存在的列表元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(numbers[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 类型不匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入年龄：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next_year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # age 是字符串，不能直接加数字</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>逻辑错误</strong>是最隐蔽的一类，程序能正常运行完毕，但输出的结果不符合预期。比如想计算平均分却忘了除以人数，或者循环次数多了一次导致结果偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阅读-python-的错误信息\">阅读 Python 的错误信息</h3><p>Python 的错误提示信息虽然是英文的，但它们遵循固定的格式，学会阅读这些信息是调试的第一步。</p>\n<p>一个典型的错误信息包含以下部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Traceback</td>\n<td>错误追踪的起始标记</td>\n<td>Traceback (most recent call last):</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>File 和行号</td>\n<td>出错的文件和具体行数</td>\n<td>File &quot;test.py&quot;, line 5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出错代码</td>\n<td>具体出错的那行代码</td>\n<td>print(numbers[10])</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误类型</td>\n<td>错误的分类名称</td>\n<td>IndexError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误描述</td>\n<td>对错误的简要说明</td>\n<td>list index out of range</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Python 中常见的错误类型及其含义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>中文含义</th>\n<th>常见原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SyntaxError</td>\n<td>语法错误</td>\n<td>拼写错误、缺少标点符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NameError</td>\n<td>名称错误</td>\n<td>使用了未定义的变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeError</td>\n<td>类型错误</td>\n<td>不同类型数据的非法操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ValueError</td>\n<td>值错误</td>\n<td>数据格式或范围不正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IndexError</td>\n<td>索引错误</td>\n<td>列表下标超出范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeroDivisionError</td>\n<td>零除错误</td>\n<td>除数为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IndentationError</td>\n<td>缩进错误</td>\n<td>缩进不一致或缺失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读懂错误信息的关键技巧：先看最后一行的错误类型和描述，确定是什么性质的错误；再看行号，定位到具体出错的代码行；最后分析原因并修复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"print-调试法\">print 调试法</h3><p><code>print()</code> 调试法是最简单也最实用的调试技巧。在程序的关键位置插入 <code>print()</code> 语句，输出变量的值和程序执行的位置，帮助我们了解程序实际的运行情况。</p>\n<p>假设有一个计算班级平均分的程序出了问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"scores = [85, 92, 78, 95, 88]&#10;total = 0&#10;count = 0&#10;&#10;for score in scores:&#10;    total = total + score&#10;&#10;average = total / count&#10;print(f&quot;平均分为：{average}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"平均分为：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行后会出现 ZeroDivisionError。我们添加 print 语句来排查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"scores = [85, 92, 78, 95, 88]&#10;total = 0&#10;count = 0&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;初始值：total={total}, count={count}&quot;)&#10;&#10;for score in scores:&#10;    total = total + score&#10;    print(f&quot;累加 {score} 后：total={total}, count={count}&quot;)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;循环结束：total={total}, count={count}&quot;)&#10;average = total / count&#10;print(f&quot;平均分为：{average}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"初始值：total=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, count=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"累加 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 后：total=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, count=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"循环结束：total=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, count=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"平均分为：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过输出结果我们可以发现：<code>count</code> 始终为 0，因为循环中只累加了 <code>total</code>，忘记了给 <code>count</code> 加 1。修复方法是在循环中添加 <code>count = count + 1</code>。</p>\n<p>print 调试法的使用原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标记位置</td>\n<td>在输出中注明是哪个位置的信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显示变量值</td>\n<td>输出关键变量的当前值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环内外都查</td>\n<td>在循环前、循环中和循环后分别输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐步添加</td>\n<td>先在可疑区域添加，再扩大范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用完即删</td>\n<td>问题解决后删除调试用的 print 语句</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"逐步排查法\">逐步排查法</h3><p>当程序较长或者 print 调试法不够用时，可以使用逐步排查法系统地定位错误。</p>\n<p><strong>逐步排查的基本步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重现问题</strong>：确认错误确实存在，记录错误的具体表现</li>\n<li><strong>缩小范围</strong>：注释掉一半的代码，看错误是否还在，逐步缩小出错范围</li>\n<li><strong>检查假设</strong>：验证每个变量的值是否符合预期</li>\n<li><strong>修复验证</strong>：修改代码后重新运行，确认问题是否真正解决</li>\n<li><strong>回归测试</strong>：确保修复没有引入新的错误</li>\n</ol>\n<p>注释代码排查的方法非常有效。在 Python 中，可以在代码行前加 <code>#</code> 号来临时禁用这行代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"scores = [85, 92, 78, 95, 88]&#10;total = 0&#10;count = len(scores)&#10;&#10;for score in scores:&#10;    total = total + score&#10;    # count = count + 1  # 暂时注释掉，看是否影响结果&#10;&#10;average = total / count&#10;print(f&quot;平均分为：{average}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # count = count + 1  # 暂时注释掉，看是否影响结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"平均分为：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">average</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见错误模式与预防\">常见错误模式与预防</h3><p>通过大量编程实践，有一些错误模式出现频率特别高，了解这些模式可以帮助我们提前预防。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误模式</th>\n<th>错误示例</th>\n<th>正确写法</th>\n<th>预防方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变量名拼写错误</td>\n<td><code>scroe</code> 而非 <code>score</code></td>\n<td><code>score</code></td>\n<td>使用有意义的完整单词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忘记类型转换</td>\n<td><code>int(input()) + 1</code> 写成 <code>input() + 1</code></td>\n<td><code>int(input(...)) + 1</code></td>\n<td>输入后立即转换类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩进不一致</td>\n<td>混用空格和 Tab</td>\n<td>统一使用 4 个空格</td>\n<td>IDLE 会自动处理缩进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表索引越界</td>\n<td>5 个元素访问第 6 个</td>\n<td>用 <code>len()</code> 检查长度</td>\n<td>访问前先判断范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环边界错误</td>\n<td>range(1, 10) 不包含 10</td>\n<td>range(1, 11)</td>\n<td>记住 range 左闭右开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较与赋值混淆</td>\n<td><code>if x = 5:</code></td>\n<td><code>if x == 5:</code></td>\n<td>判断用 <code>==</code>，赋值用 <code>=</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>良好的编程习惯是预防错误的最佳方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每写完几行代码就运行一次，及时发现问题</li>\n<li>变量名要有描述性，见名知义</li>\n<li>保持代码缩进整齐统一</li>\n<li>复杂逻辑先写注释再写代码</li>\n<li>测试时要考虑边界情况（最大值、最小值、空数据等）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"调试实战案例\">调试实战案例</h3><p>让我们用一个完整的案例来练习调试技巧。下面是一个&quot;学生成绩等级评定&quot;程序，其中包含了多个错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 有错误的版本&#10;students = [&quot;小明&quot;, &quot;小红&quot;, &quot;小华&quot;, &quot;小李&quot;]&#10;scores = [85, 92, 58, 76]&#10;&#10;for i in range(len(students)):&#10;    name = students[i]&#10;    score = scores[i]&#10;&#10;    if score &gt;= 90:&#10;        grade = &quot;优秀&quot;&#10;    if score &gt;= 80:&#10;        grade = &quot;良好&quot;&#10;    if score &gt;= 60:&#10;        grade = &quot;及格&quot;&#10;    else:&#10;        grade = &quot;不及格&quot;&#10;&#10;    print(f&quot;{name}：{score} 分，等级为 {grade}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 有错误的版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小明\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小红\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小华\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小李\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">76</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(students)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"优秀\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"良好\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"及格\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"不及格\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 分，等级为 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grade</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>仔细观察会发现：所有的 <code>if</code> 都是独立判断而非 <code>elif</code> 连接，这意味着分数 92 会先被判为&quot;优秀&quot;，接着被覆盖为&quot;良好&quot;，最终又被覆盖为&quot;及格&quot;。修复方法是将第二和第三个 <code>if</code> 改为 <code>elif</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 修复后的版本&#10;students = [&quot;小明&quot;, &quot;小红&quot;, &quot;小华&quot;, &quot;小李&quot;]&#10;scores = [85, 92, 58, 76]&#10;&#10;for i in range(len(students)):&#10;    name = students[i]&#10;    score = scores[i]&#10;&#10;    if score &gt;= 90:&#10;        grade = &quot;优秀&quot;&#10;    elif score &gt;= 80:&#10;        grade = &quot;良好&quot;&#10;    elif score &gt;= 60:&#10;        grade = &quot;及格&quot;&#10;    else:&#10;        grade = &quot;不及格&quot;&#10;&#10;    print(f&quot;{name}：{score} 分，等级为 {grade}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修复后的版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小明\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小红\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小华\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小李\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">76</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(students)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"优秀\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"良好\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"及格\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"不及格\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 分，等级为 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grade</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个案例很好地说明了逻辑错误的隐蔽性——程序能正常运行不报错，但结果完全不对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>错误分类</strong>：判断以下每个代码片段会产生什么类型的错误（语法错误、运行时错误或逻辑错误），并说明原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>print(&quot;Hello World&#39;)</code></li>\n<li><code>numbers = [1, 2, 3]; print(numbers[3])</code></li>\n<li>计算 1+2+...+10 的程序写成 <code>for i in range(1, 10)</code> 漏掉了 10</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>读懂错误</strong>：运行以下代码，记录 Python 报出的错误信息，然后解释错误原因并修复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"age = input(&quot;请输入年龄：&quot;)&#10;if age &gt; 12:&#10;    print(&quot;你是中学生&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入年龄：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是中学生\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p><strong>调试挑战</strong>：下面的程序想要找出列表中的最大值，但结果不对，请用 print 调试法找出并修复问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"numbers = [34, 67, 23, 89, 12, 56]&#10;max_num = 0&#10;for num in numbers:&#10;    if num &gt; max_num:&#10;        num = max_num&#10;print(f&quot;最大值是：{max_num}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">67</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">89</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">56</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">max_num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numbers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_num:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_num</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最大值是：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">max_num</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p><strong>预防练习</strong>：写一个程序，让用户输入一个数字作为除数来计算 100 除以该数的结果。要求程序能够处理用户输入非数字和输入零的情况，给出友好提示而不是程序崩溃。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>思考题</strong>：为什么说&quot;好的程序员不是不犯错的程序员，而是善于找错和改错的程序员&quot;？从调试的角度谈谈你的理解。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>&quot;Bug&quot;这个词在计算机领域中表示程序错误，它的由来很有趣。1947 年，美国计算机科学家格蕾丝·霍珀在调试 Mark II 计算机时，发现一只飞蛾卡在了继电器中导致计算机故障。她把这只虫子贴在了工作日志上，并写下&quot;第一个真正的 Bug 被发现&quot;。从此，&quot;Bug&quot;就成了计算机错误的代名词，而&quot;Debug&quot;就是去除错误的意思。</p>\n<p>在专业软件开发中，程序员们使用各种先进的调试工具来帮助定位错误。比如&quot;断点调试器&quot;可以让程序在指定位置暂停，逐步查看每个变量的变化情况。大型软件公司还有专门的&quot;测试工程师&quot;，他们的工作就是想尽办法寻找程序中的错误。</p>\n<p>一些大规模的软件故障曾造成重大损失。1996 年，欧洲航天局的阿丽亚娜 5 号火箭因为一个数据类型转换的 Bug 而在发射 37 秒后爆炸，损失超过 3.7 亿美元。这个故事告诉我们，仔细检查程序、做好调试测试是多么重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课我们全面学习了程序调试的知识和技能。从认识语法错误、运行时错误和逻辑错误三大类型，到学会阅读 Python 的错误提示信息；从掌握实用的 print 调试法和逐步排查法，到了解常见的错误模式和预防方法。调试能力是编程水平的重要标志——遇到错误不要慌张，冷静分析错误信息，运用系统化的调试方法，绝大多数问题都能迎刃而解。养成边写边测、仔细检查的好习惯，将大大减少错误的出现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"五年级信息科技 — 调试技巧","id":"五年级信息科技-调试技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"认识三大错误类型","id":"认识三大错误类型"},{"level":3,"text":"阅读 Python 的错误信息","id":"阅读-python-的错误信息"},{"level":3,"text":"print 调试法","id":"print-调试法"},{"level":3,"text":"逐步排查法","id":"逐步排查法"},{"level":3,"text":"常见错误模式与预防","id":"常见错误模式与预防"},{"level":3,"text":"调试实战案例","id":"调试实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"五年级信息科技 — 算法思维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming/algorithm-thinking"},"next":{"title":"五年级信息科技 — 数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/data-processing/data-collection"}}